      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Metric validation currently expects stable metrics to have strings directly in the metric definition. However, we should probably also allow consts and vars which are declared in the pkg/file scope, since those can easily be evaluated to their respective string values.\r\n\r\n/assign @serathius \r\n/sig instrumentation",
